              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Class ratios matter",
                  "`StratifiedKFold` (classifier default)"
                ],
                [
                  "Time order",
                  "`TimeSeriesSplit`"
                ],
                [
                  "Rows per entity",
                  "`GroupKFold`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`GridSearchCV` uses CV for **model selection** and tuning",
                "Keep an ==untouched test set== for the final score",
