              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Preprocessing outside the `Pipeline` (leakage)",
                "Tuning on the test set",
                "Reporting only the mean, ignoring the ==std== across folds"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why CV, not one split?** Every row validates once; the mean is steadier.",
                "**When is plain k-fold wrong?** Imbalanced classes, time data, grouped rows.",
                "**Nested CV?** Inner loop tunes, outer loop scores; avoids optimistic bias."
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
